.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/images/14/b2d/a54e44518997cb887c8f7df4d68ac-04.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑ひなさんと❣️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなさん×ひなので「ひなひな」ですね！って話してました😆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は衣装のデザインが一期生さん、二期生さん、三期生(上村ひなの)でそれぞれ違うのです😃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の印象は一期生さんの衣装と二期生さんの衣装を混ぜた感じの衣装です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもたくさんMVが公開されていくと思いますが私にとって全てお気に入りなので楽しみにしていてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ読んで下さってありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね🌷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上村ひなの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"55,なの"}],"source":"official"}}